  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "An NES port of the game Gravitar, that was originally released on the the first Atari Flashback console in 2004. \r\n\r\nThe evil being called Gravitar is out attempting to destroy the universe! With each galaxy he conquers he leaves behind extreme gravitational forces, a powerful, explosive reactor and deadly bunkers. Your job is to stop Gravitar by taking back the twelve solar systems located in four galaxies that are under his control! In each solar system there is a sun, an alien reactor base, and three to four planets. To free the solar system, you have two choices; either visit all of the planets and destroy all enemy bunkers, or activate the reactor at the core of the alien base and escape before it explodes."
    }
  ],
